# Benchmark artifacts whose CURRENT bytes a measurement receipt hashes.
# `_OUTPUT_PATHS` in benchmarks/receipt.py lists them, and
# scripts/check_benchmark_docs.py fails when they change, so that a published
# number stays tamper-evident. Editing their prose would mean re-running the
# benchmark, which changes what the numbers mean. The rest of benchmarks/ is
# NOT excluded: its Python sources are verified against the bytes committed at
# the receipt's own source_commit, read from git history, so editing a comment
# or a docstring today does not invalidate a past measurement.
benchmarks/governance_results/ablation.md
benchmarks/governance_results/embeddings/ablation.md
benchmarks/results/report.md
